## Email Format

When delivering as email:

```
To: [Leadership — suggest based on content severity: VP level for 🔴, Director for 🟡]
Subject: Daily Pulse — [Date] | [🔴 X urgent / 🟡 Y watching / 📰 Z FYI]

[Brief prose intro — 1 sentence: "One item requires attention before your first meeting today."]

[Then the brief content in clean prose, no ASCII dividers]

—
Daily Pulse | Bizops AI | Auto-generated [time]
```
